  excerpt: 'Romantic, adventurous, and absolutely unforgettable honeymoon experience.',
  fullReview: 'We chose the fly-in Mara safari for our honeymoon and it was pure magic. The small plane ride over the Rift Valley was breathtaking. Our luxury camp had a private tent with a huge bed, outdoor shower, and personal butler service. The privacy was perfect for newlyweds. Game drives revealed lions, elephants, and even a cheetah with cubs. Sundowners with champagne overlooking the plains, candlelit dinners under the stars, and waking up to the sounds of Africa - it was all incredibly romantic. The staff surprised us with a special anniversary setup. Worth every euro! Kenya is perfect for honeymoons.',
