  excerpt: 'Hot air balloon over the Mara was the single most incredible experience of my life.',
  fullReview: 'The balloon safari alone made this entire trip worthwhile. Floating silently above the Mara at sunrise while thousands of wildebeest grazed below was absolutely magical. Our pilot was skilled and entertaining. The champagne breakfast in the bush afterward felt like a scene from Out of Africa. Beyond the balloon, the regular game drives were excellent - saw four lions on a kill, elephants bathing, and a leopard in a tree. The luxury camp had everything - comfortable beds, hot showers, excellent food. Our Maasai guide was knowledgeable and friendly. This is how safari should be done. Expensive but absolutely worth it!',
