  excerpt: 'Absolutely stunning landscapes and wildlife you won\'t see anywhere else.',
  fullReview: 'Samburu blew us away! The rugged landscape is dramatically different from typical safari destinations. Saw all of Samburu\'s special five - reticulated giraffes are absolutely gorgeous, Grevy\'s zebras are larger and more beautiful than common zebras, and gerenuks standing on hind legs to feed are fascinating. Also saw plenty of lions, leopards, and elephants. The Ewaso Nyiro River creates an oasis effect. Our guide was Samburu tribe and his cultural insights added so much depth. The flying safari made travel easy. Luxury lodge was exceptional. Samburu deserves way more recognition. Absolutely loved it!',
