  bushVibe: 3.5,
  sceneryRating: 4.0,
  birdingRating: 3.5,
  date: 'May 22, 2022',
  excerpt: 'Solid safari experience with room for improvement.',
  fullReview: 'Three days in Masai Mara through the adventure tour. Wildlife viewing was good - saw four of Big Five (missed leopard) and great herbivore herds. However, budget accommodation was very basic with cold showers and inconsistent electricity. Food was repetitive. Our guide was okay but English was sometimes difficult to understand. Game drives felt rushed - guide seemed eager to finish and go home. Other groups we met had better experiences with their guides. Mara itself is spectacular so still worthwhile. For $999 can\'t complain too much but consider paying more for better guide and accommodation. Photography was challenging in crowded vehicle with 7 people.',
  helpful: 167,
  verified: true,
