  bushVibe: 2.0,
  sceneryRating: 3.5,
  birdingRating: 2.0,
  date: 'March 5, 2022',
  excerpt: 'Many issues overshadowed the wildlife viewing.',
  fullReview: 'Had high hopes for this tour but left disappointed. Vehicle broke down twice causing us to miss full morning game drive. Replacement vehicle was overcrowded with poor visibility. Lodge had no hot water for two days and staff was unhelpful. Food gave me stomach issues. Our guide seemed inexperienced - other guides were finding animals while we drove around aimlessly. Did see some wildlife but nothing spectacular. The Mara is beautiful but this operator needs serious improvement. Customer service was poor when we complained. Save your money and book with reputable company. Very frustrating experience for the cost.',
  helpful: 189,
