  birdingRating: 3.0,
  date: 'January 28, 2022',
  excerpt: 'Some great moments but organizational issues affected enjoyment.',
  fullReview: 'Tsavo and Amboseli tour had highlights but frustrations too. Wildlife viewing was good especially in Amboseli with elephant herds and Kilimanjaro views. Tsavo felt emptier but saw red elephants which was cool. However, timing was off - we arrived at Tsavo during hottest part of day when animals were hiding. Accommodation at one lodge had cleanliness issues. Breakfast was delayed one morning making us late for game drive. Our guide was friendly but not particularly knowledgeable about animal behavior. The Mombasa beach extension was nice break. Overall okay experience but could have been much better with better planning and attention to detail. Shop around before booking.',
