  sceneryRating: 3.5,
  birdingRating: 3.0,
  date: 'April 2, 2021',
  excerpt: 'Several issues detracted from what should have been amazing experience.',
  fullReview: 'Had been dreaming of Kenya safari for years so perhaps expectations were too high. Wildlife viewing was decent but not exceptional - saw most animals but from distance and only brief leopard sighting. Accommodations were tired and in need of renovation. Staff tried their best but seemed understaffed. Vehicle was uncomfortable with broken seat and weak AC in hot weather. Guide was okay but lacked enthusiasm. Other groups seemed to be having better experiences with their operators. The parks themselves are beautiful but felt let down by tour operator. Customer service was poor when raised concerns - no compensation or acknowledgment. For the price paid, expected much more. Consider other operators before booking.',
