  birdingRating: 4.6,
  date: 'June 28, 2019',
  excerpt: 'Perfect blend of culture, wildlife, beach, and adventure.',
  fullReview: 'The 12-day Kenya coast vacation was absolutely brilliant. Mombasa\'s Fort Jesus and old town were fascinating. Wasini Island dolphin watching was magical - saw large pods swimming alongside boat. Diani Beach was paradise with pristine white sand and turquoise water. Snorkeling was excellent. Funzi Island dhow cruise was peaceful and beautiful. Shimba Hills safari was unexpected highlight - saw elephants, sable antelopes, and beautiful waterfalls. The variety kept everything interesting. Accommodations ranged from excellent to outstanding. Food was delicious especially fresh seafood. Our guide was flexible and accommodating. This tour perfect for families or anyone wanting more than just safari. The combination of experiences made it comprehensive Kenya adventure. Loved every moment!',
  helpful: 401,
  verified: true,
  tourTaken: '12-Day Vacation Escape to Kenya Coast',
