  bushVibe: 4.8,
  sceneryRating: 5.0,
  birdingRating: 4.6,
  date: 'April 15, 2019',
  excerpt: 'Hot air balloon over Mara was absolutely magical.',
  fullReview: 'The 4-day Mara safari with balloon ride was phenomenal. The hot air balloon at sunrise was bucket list experience - floating silently over endless plains watching wildlife wake up was surreal. Champagne breakfast in the bush afterward was perfect. Game drives were equally impressive with multiple lion prides, cheetah family, and elephants. Our luxury camp was beautiful with excellent service and gourmet food. The Maasai village visit was educational and respectful. Guide was outstanding - patient, knowledgeable, and excellent photographer who helped us get amazing shots. Four days was perfect length. Yes it\'s expensive but the quality and experiences justify the cost. The balloon safari alone worth significant portion of price. Highly recommend for special occasions!',
