  bushVibe: 4.2,
  sceneryRating: 4.3,
  birdingRating: 4.2,
  date: 'March 22, 2019',
  excerpt: 'Good balance of quality and value for money.',
  fullReview: 'The 7-day circuit safari hit sweet spot between budget and luxury. Accommodations were comfortable without being extravagant. Food was consistently good. Saw all Big Five across the three parks which was our main goal. Masai Mara delivered abundant wildlife including great predator sightings. Lake Nakuru\'s flamingos and rhinos were beautiful. Amboseli\'s elephants against Kilimanjaro made for stunning photos. Our guide was experienced and professional. Vehicle was comfortable for long drives. Group size of six was manageable. Some lodges better than others but overall standard was acceptable. Seven days allowed good time in each park without feeling rushed. For the price point, this offered excellent value. Recommended for those wanting quality safari experience without ultra-luxury pricing.',
  helpful: 267,
  verified: true,
  tourTaken: '7-Day Kenyan Luxury Safari',
  tourId: '7-Day-Kenyan-Luxury-Safari'
