  birdingRating: 4.2,
  date: 'July 28, 2024',
  excerpt: 'Coffee plantation tour and waterfall hike added special cultural dimension to safari.',
  fullReview: 'This tour offered wonderful diversity beyond typical game drives. Tarangire elephants and Ngorongoro Big Five were excellent as expected. But Materuni Waterfall hike through lush forest was beautiful adventure - trail passed through coffee plantations and local villages. Swimming in natural pool at waterfall base was refreshing. The traditional coffee ceremony with locals was fascinating - picking beans, roasting over fire, grinding by hand, and drinking while learning about their culture and daily life. Guide balanced wildlife and cultural experiences perfectly. Lodges were comfortable and authentic. This diversity made trip more meaningful and memorable. Perfect for travelers wanting holistic Tanzania experience!',
