  sceneryRating: 4.7,
  birdingRating: 4.5,
  date: 'September 5, 2024',
  excerpt: 'Saw African wild dogs hunting! The remoteness and wilderness were unmatched.',
  fullReview: 'Chose Ruaha for its reputation as Tanzania\'s wild secret and wasn\'t disappointed! The park is genuinely remote - drove hours sometimes seeing no other vehicles which made sightings feel exclusive and special. Wildlife was exceptional with rare African wild dog pack (15 individuals hunting cooperatively!). Saw massive elephant herds numbering hundreds, multiple lion prides including cubs, and leopards. The Great Ruaha River provided dramatic backdrop concentrating wildlife. Mikumi added different landscapes and species diversity. Accommodations were authentic bush camps with stunning river views. Guide was passionate conservationist with impressive knowledge. This is Tanzania\'s best-kept secret for serious enthusiasts wanting true wilderness!',
  helpful: 312,
  verified: true,
  tourTaken: '4-Day Astonish Mikumi NP and Ruaha National Park',
