  birdingRating: 5.0,
  date: 'June 22, 2024',
  excerpt: 'Boat safari on Rufiji River and walking safari offered completely unique perspectives!',
  fullReview: 'This tour\'s activity variety made it exceptionally special! Rufiji River boat safari was incredible - glided silently past massive hippo pods (over 70!), enormous crocodiles basking on muddy banks, and elephants drinking at water\'s edge. Bird watching was absolutely outstanding with fish eagles diving, colorful kingfishers, and stunning carmine bee-eaters. The walking safari with experienced armed ranger was adrenaline-pumping - tracking animals on foot, reading territorial signs, and experiencing bush at ground level changes entire perspective. Mikumi had excellent general game viewing. Guide excelled at all activities. Perfect for adventurous nature enthusiasts wanting more than vehicle-based viewing!',
