  excerpt: 'All Big Five including black rhino for budget price. Quality wildlife viewing!',
  fullReview: 'Traveling on budget but wanted quality safari. This delivered spectacularly! Tarangire had hundreds of elephants creating dramatic scenes everywhere. Ngorongoro Crater was absolute highlight - saw all Big Five in single morning including rare black rhino. Lions were feeding on buffalo kill - incredibly dramatic. Lake Manyara had diverse landscapes with pink flamingos and unique tree-climbing lions. Group safari format kept costs reasonable but guide was still excellent and vehicle comfortable. Basic lodges were clean with hot showers and decent meals. Wildlife viewing quality rivaled expensive tours. This proves budget doesn\'t mean compromising animal encounters. Outstanding value for budget-conscious travelers!',
