  birdingRating: 4.6,
  date: 'September 8, 2024',
  excerpt: 'Six river crossings witnessed! Dramatic predator action and endless herds.',
  fullReview: 'The Great Migration exceeded wildest expectations! Our guide\'s expertise in predicting herd movements was remarkable - positioned us perfectly for six different river crossings over three days. The drama was absolutely intense with crocodiles attacking mid-stream creating explosive action. The sheer numbers of wildebeest and zebras was overwhelming - horizon completely filled with moving masses. Also saw lions hunting cooperatively, cheetahs sprinting at full speed, and leopards dragging kills into trees. Ngorongoro Crater added all Big Five including rhinos. Tarangire elephants were magnificent. Luxury camps were exceptional with gourmet meals. This is once-in-lifetime experience worth every won!',
