  birdingRating: 4.2,
  date: 'July 15, 2024',
  excerpt: 'Camp crew made this special - safety, comfort, and incredible bush meals!',
  fullReview: 'This camping safari was authentic African adventure at its best! The crew was absolutely outstanding - efficient camp setup even in challenging conditions, delicious three-course meals cooked over open campfire (how?!), and ensured our complete safety and comfort throughout. Sleeping in tents listening to lions roaring and hyenas calling nearby was thrilling but felt completely safe with experienced crew. Serengeti game viewing was excellent with multiple predator sightings daily. Ngorongoro Crater delivered Big Five spectacularly. Kilimanjaro waterfall trek was beautiful. Maasai cultural visits were genuine and respectful. The authentic bush experience with exceptional crew made this truly special. Perfect for adventurous souls!',
