  excerpt: 'Three action-packed days - Big Five, mountain hiking, waterfall swimming, and coffee culture!',
  fullReview: 'This tour brilliantly combined wildlife and adventure activities! Ngorongoro Crater was absolutely spectacular - saw all Big Five including black rhino in stunning natural amphitheater setting. Wildlife density was remarkable. Mount Kilimanjaro rainforest trek was challenging but incredibly rewarding - saw colobus monkeys, exotic birds, and lush vegetation. Views from first camp were breathtaking. Materuni Waterfall hike ended with refreshing swim in crystal-clear natural pool. Traditional coffee ceremony was educational highlight - learning roasting, grinding, and brewing techniques from locals. Guide balanced activities expertly. Accommodations comfortable with good food. Despite three days, experienced incredible Tanzania diversity. Perfect for active travelers!',
