  birdingRating: 4.6,
  date: 'September 18, 2024',
  excerpt: 'Private guide, exceptional camps, gourmet dining. Safari perfection in every detail!',
  fullReview: 'Celebrated 25th anniversary with this premium safari - absolutely worth the investment! Having private guide and vehicle meant complete flexibility and personalized attention. Spent hours photographing leopard family, following lion pride through hunting sequence, and choosing our exact schedule. Guide\'s expertise was exceptional with deep knowledge of animal behavior. Serengeti delivered cheetah hunts, endless wildebeest herds, and dramatic landscapes. Tarangire elephants were magnificent against baobab scenery. Ngorongoro had all Big Five. The luxury camps were absolutely stunning - spacious tents, proper beds, en-suite bathrooms, and incredible views. Gourmet meals rivaled finest restaurants with premium wines. Service impeccable throughout. Safari perfection!',
