  author: 'Daniel Svensson',
  country: 'SE',
  countryFlag: 'se',
  title: 'Balloon safari - Most magical experience ever',
  rating: 4.775,
  wildlifeRating: 4.7,
  bushVibe: 4.9,
  sceneryRating: 5.0,
  birdingRating: 4.5,
  date: 'August 25, 2024',
  excerpt: 'Floating silently over Serengeti at sunrise - absolutely transcendent and spiritual!',
  fullReview: 'The hot air balloon safari was single most extraordinary experience of my entire life! Pre-dawn wake-up was challenging but watching massive balloon inflate under starry African sky was thrilling start. Once airborne, profound silence was surreal - floating peacefully above endless golden plains as magnificent sunrise painted sky in oranges and pinks. Watched elephants, giraffes, wildebeest, and zebras wake up far below. The aerial perspective is completely different and deeply spiritual experience. Landed for champagne breakfast in middle of bush which felt like dream. Regular game drives were also outstanding with expert guide. Flying in saved enormous travel time. Luxury camp impeccable. Bucket list experience that exceeded every expectation!',
