  birdingRating: 4.4,
  date: 'July 18, 2024',
  excerpt: 'Lake Manyara\'s tree-climbing lions were fascinating! Lodges were absolutely luxurious.',
  fullReview: 'This high-end safari delivered exceptional experiences throughout! Lake Manyara\'s famous tree-climbing lions were incredible - five lions lounging comfortably in large acacia tree branches escaping ground heat and insects. Guide explained this unique behavior developed specifically in this population. Serengeti had outstanding predator activity including leopard with impala kill and multiple lion pride interactions. Ngorongoro Crater was absolutely spectacular with all Big Five concentrated in stunning natural amphitheater. The lodges were gorgeous - infinity pools overlooking endless savannah, luxurious spa facilities, and restaurant-quality French cuisine. Service professional and attentive. Four days perfectly balanced game viewing and relaxation. Outstanding value for high-end experience!',
