fullReview: 'Traveling on limited budget but wanted quality Tanzania safari experience. This delivered spectacularly beyond expectations! Tarangire had hundreds of elephants creating dramatic scenes everywhere - families bathing, babies playing, bulls sparring. Ngorongoro Crater was absolute highlight - saw all Big Five in single incredible morning including rare black rhino. Lions were feeding on buffalo kill creating dramatic scene. Lake Manyara had diverse beautiful landscapes with pink flamingos and unique tree-climbing lions. Group safari kept costs very reasonable but guide still excellent and vehicle comfortable. Basic lodges clean with hot showers and decent meals. Wildlife viewing quality rivaled expensive tours. Outstanding value!',
