date: 'September 5, 2024',
excerpt: 'No crowds, perfect lighting, patient guide. Got incredible portfolio shots!',
fullReview: 'Specifically chose Ruaha for serious wildlife photography opportunities - delivered beyond wildest expectations! The remoteness meant exclusive sightings with absolutely no vehicles crowding shots or disturbing natural animal behavior. Guide understood photography needs perfectly - positioning for optimal golden hour light, infinite patience for behavioral moments, and deep knowledge of animal movement patterns. Photographed wild dogs mid-hunt sequence, lions with fresh kills in perfect dramatic light, and leopards against stunning natural backdrops. Walking safari along Great Ruaha River offered unique rare ground-level perspectives. Landscapes diverse - ancient baobabs, dramatic rocky kopjes, beautiful river scenes. Hidden gem for serious photographers!',
