date: 'September 15, 2024',
excerpt: 'Seven river crossings witnessed! Dramatic predator-prey interactions everywhere.',
fullReview: `The Great Migration exceeded every possible expectation and imagination! Our guide's expertise in predicting complex herd movements was absolutely remarkable - positioned us perfectly for seven different dramatic river crossings over four days. The intensity and drama were overwhelming with massive crocodiles attacking mid-stream creating explosive action scenes. The sheer endless numbers of wildebeest and zebras was mind-boggling - entire horizon completely filled with moving masses stretching to infinity. Also saw lions hunting cooperatively, cheetahs sprinting at incredible full speed, and leopards dragging heavy kills into trees. Ngorongoro added all Big Five. Tarangire elephants magnificent. Luxury camps exceptional. Once-in-lifetime experience worth everything!`,
