fullReview: 'The hot air balloon safari was single most extraordinary magical experience of my entire life! Pre-dawn wake-up challenging but watching massive colorful balloon inflate under brilliant starry African sky was absolutely thrilling start. Once airborne, profound peaceful silence was completely surreal - floating gracefully above endless golden plains as magnificent sunrise painted entire sky in brilliant oranges, pinks, and purples. Watched elephants, giraffes, wildebeest, and zebras wake up far below. Aerial perspective completely different and deeply spiritual moving experience. Landed for champagne breakfast in middle of bush feeling dreamlike. Regular game drives outstanding. Flying in saved enormous time. Luxury camp impeccable. Bucket list experience exceeded every expectation!',
