  birdingRating: 4.2,
  date: 'March 18, 2023',
  excerpt: 'Great value for money. Saw tons of wildlife and our guide was fantastic.',
  fullReview: 'Wasn\'t sure what to expect from a budget safari but this was genuinely amazing! Yes, the camping accommodations were basic but clean and comfortable enough. What really mattered was the wildlife - we saw incredible elephant herds in Tarangire, all Big Five in Ngorongoro, and even witnessed a lion hunt in Serengeti. Our guide James was knowledgeable and patient, answering endless questions from our group. Food was simple but tasty. Only downside was the long drives between parks, but that\'s just geography. For the price, this was outstanding value.',
