  sceneryRating: 5.0,
  birdingRating: 4.7,
  date: 'June 22, 2022',
  excerpt: 'Perfect honeymoon! Safari adventure plus beach relaxation was ideal combination.',
  fullReview: 'This trip was absolutely perfect honeymoon experience! Safari portion had us completely mesmerized - watching sunset over Serengeti with champagne, seeing massive elephant families, witnessing wildebeest migration. Lodges were incredibly romantic with private decks and outdoor showers under stars. Then Zanzibar portion was pure bliss - pristine white sand beaches, turquoise water, incredible seafood. Resort was luxurious with perfect service. The contrast between wild bush adventure and tropical beach paradise made this unforgettable. Worth every penny. Already planning return trip for anniversary!',
