  birdingRating: 4.0,
  date: 'August 14, 2023',
  excerpt: 'Wildlife viewing was excellent but had some hiccups with logistics.',
  fullReview: 'Overall enjoyed the safari though there were some frustrating moments. Wildlife viewing was fantastic - saw leopard, cheetah, lions with cubs, and huge elephant herds. Ngorongoro Crater was breathtaking. However, there were organizational issues. First day our vehicle had mechanical problems causing 3-hour delay. One lodge hadn\'t received our reservation properly though they accommodated us. Guide was good but not as knowledgeable as expected. Food at camps was hit or miss - some meals excellent, others mediocre. Despite issues, the wildlife experience itself was incredible enough to mostly make up for it. Just wish logistics were smoother.',
