  excerpt: 'Flying from Zanzibar saved time. Saw incredible migration. Unforgettable!',
  fullReview: 'Starting from Zanzibar was brilliant - morning flight meant by lunch we were already in Serengeti watching wildebeest migration. The sheer scale was absolutely overwhelming - hundreds of thousands of animals stretching to horizon. Witnessed dramatic river crossing with crocodiles - intense! Tarangire elephants were everywhere, some with babies. Ngorongoro black rhino sighting was special. Camps were luxurious tented style, very comfortable. Guide extremely knowledgeable about migration patterns. Only issue was weather - rained one afternoon limiting visibility. But overall this combination of beach holiday with intense safari was perfect balance. The fly-in saved us days of driving time.',
