  excerpt: 'Perfect for photographers. Guide understood our needs. Incredible shots!',
  fullReview: 'As serious wildlife photographer, this tour was absolutely perfect! Guide immediately understood our photographic needs - positioning vehicle for best light, staying patient at sightings, knowing where to find subjects. Got incredible shots of leopard at golden hour, backlit elephants at sunrise, dramatic storm clouds over Serengeti. Tarangire baobabs made stunning compositions. Ngorongoro provided close-up opportunities with crater walls as backdrop. Lake Manyara birdlife was exceptional - hundreds of species. Guide also photographer so gave helpful tips. Lodges had good WiFi for backing up images. Only wish was more days! This was photographer\'s dream safari. Highly recommend for serious photography enthusiasts.',
