  fullReview: 'Really appreciated that this wasn\'t just endless game drives but included other experiences. Materuni Waterfall hike was beautiful - lush vegetation, refreshing swim at bottom. Coffee plantation tour was fascinating, learned entire process and coffee was delicious. Arusha cultural experience gave context to local life. Wildlife viewing in Tarangire and Ngorongoro was excellent - saw all Big Five, many elephant herds. Lodges were nice with helpful staff. Guide was patient and informative. Only minor issue was tight schedule some days felt rushed. But overall great balance of wildlife, culture, and natural beauty. Felt like got fuller picture of Tanzania beyond just animals.',
