  excerpt: 'River perspective amazing. Walking safari thrilling. Great variety of activities.',
  fullReview: 'Loved the variety of activities on this tour! Boat safari on Rufiji River was incredible different perspective - gliding silently past massive hippo pods, crocodiles sunbathing, diverse water birds. Got much closer to wildlife than from vehicle. Walking safari was thrilling - tracking animals on foot with armed ranger made you feel part of ecosystem rather than observer. Mikumi game drives were productive with good predator sightings. Birding was exceptional throughout - guide helped identify over 200 species. Accommodations comfortable. Food good. Guide knowledgeable about both wildlife and ecosystems. This tour perfect for people wanting more active, varied safari experience beyond just driving.',
