  sceneryRating: 4.7,
  birdingRating: 4.4,
  date: 'August 20, 2022',
  excerpt: 'Cannot believe how much we saw for this price. Excellent budget choice.',
  fullReview: 'Researched many budget safaris and this offered best itinerary for money. Three parks in three days meant efficient use of time. Tarangire elephants were incredible - hundreds of them! Ngorongoro Crater was absolute highlight with all Big Five spotted including difficult black rhino. Lake Manyara flamingos created pink carpet on lake. Camping was basic but fine - tents were weatherproof, sleeping bags warm, camp staff friendly and food surprisingly good. Shared group was fun - met interesting people from five countries. Guide worked hard to find us good sightings. Yes, some long drives and basic facilities but for budget traveler wanting authentic experience, this was fantastic value. Highly recommend!',
