  birdingRating: 4.5,
  date: 'November 16, 2023',
  excerpt: 'Tracking animals on foot was incredibly thrilling. Remote Ruaha delivered.',
  fullReview: 'Walking safari in Ruaha was absolute highlight of entire trip - tracking lion pride on foot with armed guide was exhilarating in way that vehicle safari never matches. Every sense heightened, reading tracks and signs, getting dangerously close to buffalo herd before carefully backing away. Great Ruaha River game drives were excellent too - lions, elephants, giraffes in beautiful riverine setting. Learned about smaller creatures, plants, and ecosystems not just big animals. Camp was rustic but comfortable with amazing night sounds. Guide was experienced professional who prioritized safety while delivering authentic bush experience. This for adventurous travelers wanting deeper connection with wilderness. Absolutely recommended!',
