  date: 'February 14, 2023',
  excerpt: 'Good wildlife but had issues with accommodation quality and organization.',
  fullReview: 'Trip had definite ups and downs. Wildlife viewing was generally good - saw lions, leopard, elephants, and lots of plains game. Serengeti landscape was beautiful. However, had issues with one of the lodges which was run-down and not clean - complained to tour operator who apologized but couldn\'t change anything mid-trip. Another day our lunch wasn\'t prepared so had to wait two hours. Guide was friendly but English was limited making explanations difficult to understand. Some game drives felt too short. On positive side, Ngorongoro Crater was spectacular and one lodge was actually very nice. Mixed experience overall - great moments but enough problems to be frustrating. Expected better for price paid.',
