  birdingRating: 4.3,
  date: 'September 10, 2022',
  excerpt: 'Perfect honeymoon blend of luxury, romance and wildlife adventure.',
  fullReview: 'This was dream honeymoon! Safari portion had all the adventure and excitement - tracking lions, watching elephants, amazing sunsets over Serengeti. Lodges were incredibly romantic with canopy beds, outdoor showers, private decks overlooking waterholes. Staff went above and beyond with special touches - flower petals on bed, champagne surprises, private dinners under stars. Then Zanzibar was perfect contrast - luxurious beach resort, crystal clear water, romantic sunset cruises, delicious seafood, couples spa treatments. The combination of wild adventure and tropical romance was exactly what we wanted. Created memories we\'ll treasure forever. Worth every cent. Can\'t recommend enough for honeymoon or anniversary!',
