  birdingRating: 4.2,
  date: 'December 12, 2023',
  excerpt: 'Only had 3 days but saw everything we hoped for. Well organized.',
  fullReview: 'With limited vacation time, needed efficient safari that maximized experience and this delivered perfectly! Itinerary cleverly designed to minimize driving while hitting best spots. Kilimanjaro hike through rainforest was beautiful - saw colobus monkeys and unique birds. Ngorongoro Crater packed full day with all Big Five spotted including both rhino species. Materuni waterfall swim was refreshing reward after hike. Coffee tour was interesting cultural addition. Guide was punctual and organized - no wasted time. Lodge comfortable with good food. While three days obviously can\'t compare to longer safaris, this excellent option for time-limited travelers. Felt satisfied with experience and ready to return for longer trip!',
