fullReview: `Highlight was definitely Lake Manyara's famous tree-climbing lions - took time but eventually found pride of four lions lounging in large acacia branches. Guide explained this unique behavior developed to escape heat and insects. Photographed them for nearly an hour! Serengeti delivered everything hoped for - massive herds, multiple lion prides, cheetahs, even leopard sighting. Ngorongoro Crater was stunning natural amphitheater packed with wildlife - saw all Big Five in single morning. Lodges exceeded expectations - beautifully designed, excellent service, outstanding food, infinity pools with incredible views. This perfect blend of exceptional wildlife and luxury comfort. Four days felt right length. Highly recommend!`,
