excerpt: 'Lake Manyara lions incredible sight! Luxury lodges beautiful. Excellent safari.',
fullReview: `Lake Manyara's tree-climbing lions were absolutely spectacular - spent hour photographing pride of five lounging comfortably across thick acacia branches. Guide explained fascinating adaptation unique to this population escaping ground heat and tsetse flies. Serengeti delivered consistently - multiple lion prides, cheetahs, even elusive leopard sighting. Ngorongoro Crater breathtaking natural amphitheater densely packed with wildlife - all Big Five in dramatic setting. Lodges genuinely luxurious - beautifully designed architecture, excellent service, outstanding cuisine, infinity pools with sweeping savannah views. This perfect combination exceptional wildlife viewing and high-end comfort. Four days felt ideal length. Guide expert at finding and explaining wildlife behavior. Highly recommend for luxury safari seekers!`,
