date: 'August 31, 2022',
excerpt: 'Flight from Zanzibar brilliant! Migration river crossing unforgettable!',
fullReview: 'Flying from Zanzibar to Serengeti was absolute game-changer - avoided two exhausting days of driving, arrived fresh and ready for immediate safari action. Migration timing perfect - witnessed spectacular Mara River crossing with thousands of wildebeest plunging into water while crocodiles attacked from below. Most dramatic wildlife event imaginable! Followed migration herds across northern Serengeti - endless columns of animals creating massive dust clouds. Tarangire elephants impressive. Ngorongoro rhino sighting special bonus. Luxury tented camps beautifully appointed and comfortable. Guide passionate expert on migration patterns. Itinerary perfectly designed for time-limited travelers wanting maximum wildlife experience. Flying added cost but absolutely worth time and convenience gained. Migration was bucket list experience exceeded expectations!',
