excerpt: 'Good balance quality and price. Covered highlights well. No complaints.',
fullReview: 'Selected this mid-range option after extensive comparison and felt satisfied with choice. Tarangire had impressive elephant concentrations - dozens at waterholes including adorable babies. Serengeti landscape absolutely breathtaking with good wildlife variety - lions, hyenas, jackals, countless plains game. Ngorongoro Crater spectacular with all Big Five spotted in beautiful dramatic setting. Lodges were solid mid-range - clean comfortable rooms, decent food, friendly helpful staff, nice communal areas. Nothing fancy but everything functioned well. Guide experienced at locating wildlife and knowledgeable about behavior. Vehicle comfortable for long drives. No significant issues or disappointments. For budget-conscious travelers wanting quality safari experience without luxury prices, this represents good value. Recommended!',
