birdingRating: 4.9,
date: 'April 6, 2023',
excerpt: 'Walking safari thrilling! Boat peaceful. Loved activity variety. Excellent!',
fullReview: 'Absolutely loved diversity of safari activities! Walking safari was exhilarating - tracking animals on foot with armed ranger provided completely different bush perspective. Noticed incredible details - tracks, insects, plants, dung - missed from vehicles. Close giraffe encounter unforgettable! Boat safari on Rufiji River offered peaceful contrast - gliding silently past massive hippo pods, basking crocodiles, spectacular birds. Regular Mikumi game drives productive with elephants and predators. Each activity revealed different ecosystem aspects. Camps comfortable authentic. Guide expertly handled all safari types - vehicle, boat, walking. Perfect for active adventurous travelers wanting varied comprehensive safari experience beyond standard driving. Activities complemented each other brilliantly. Highly recommended!',
