birdingRating: 4.7,
date: 'September 3, 2022',
excerpt: 'Witnessed river crossing drama! Thousands of wildebeest. Unforgettable experience!',
fullReview: `Timed our visit perfectly for Great Migration and it was absolutely spectacular! Watched thousands of wildebeest gathering nervously at Mara River edge before finally stampeding into water. Crocodiles lunged from below creating absolute chaos and drama. Most intense wildlife spectacle imaginable! Following days tracked migration herds - endless columns stretching to horizon creating massive dust clouds. Predators everywhere - lions, cheetahs, hyenas all following feast. Ngorongoro Crater and Tarangire were excellent additions. Lodges beautiful with exceptional service. Guide's migration expertise was crucial - knew exactly where to position us. This once-in-lifetime bucket list experience that exceeded every expectation. Worth planning entire trip around migration timing!`,
