  fullReview: `Ruaha absolutely exceeded expectations - wildly underrated park! Remote location meant hours without encountering another vehicle. Wildlife phenomenal - witnessed endangered wild dog pack coordinating sophisticated hunt (guide said extremely rare privilege!), encountered massive lion prides exceeding 25 individuals, huge elephant herds, beautiful greater kudu and sable antelope. Landscapes dramatically varied - ancient baobab forests, riverside acacia woodlands, dramatic granite outcrops. SGR train from Dar was comfortable scenic journey. Mikumi provided excellent warm-up. Ruaha camps offered authentic bush experience - rustic yet comfortable, excellent food, fell asleep to nearby lion roars! Guide deeply passionate with intimate park knowledge. Perfect for serious wildlife enthusiasts wanting genuine remote wilderness. Absolutely spectacular!`,
  helpful: 418,
  verified: true,
  tourTaken: '4-Day Astonish Mikumi NP and Ruaha National Park',
  tourId: '4-day-astonish-mikumi-ruaha-national-park'
