  excerpt: `On-foot tracking exhilarating! Boat safari peaceful! Perfect activity balance!`,
  fullReview: `Absolutely loved incredible diversity of safari activities! Walking safari was genuinely exhilarating - tracking animals on foot with armed ranger provided completely different bush perspective. Noticed amazing details - fresh tracks, insect life, medicinal plants, animal dung - completely missed from vehicles. Close giraffe encounter absolutely unforgettable! Boat safari on Rufiji River offered peaceful beautiful contrast - gliding silently past massive hippo pods, enormous basking crocodiles, spectacular diverse birdlife. Regular Mikumi game drives productive with lions, elephants, various antelope species. Each activity revealed different fascinating ecosystem aspects. Camps comfortable authentic. Guide expertly handled all safari types. Perfect for active adventurous travelers wanting comprehensive varied experience beyond standard driving!`,
