  date: 'February 28, 2025',
  excerpt: `Three days packed highlights! Ngorongoro spectacular! Well organized!`,
  fullReview: `With severely limited vacation time, this three-day safari brilliantly maximized available experience. Kilimanjaro rainforest hike was absolutely stunning - encountered playful colobus monkeys, beautiful blue monkeys, vibrant colorful birds in incredibly lush vegetation. Ngorongoro Crater was absolutely spectacular - spotted entire Big Five including very rare black rhino in single extraordinary morning! Materuni Waterfall hike through aromatic coffee plantations educational and beautiful, waterfall pool swim wonderfully refreshing after steep hot hike. Traditional coffee roasting tour was fascinating interactive experience. Lodge comfortable with excellent food and genuinely friendly staff. Guide kept perfect efficient pace. Three days obviously can't match longer safaris but cleverly designed hitting absolute must-see highlights. Perfect for time-constrained travelers!`, 
