    excerpt: `Sunrise beautiful but flight short and expensive. Mixed overall experience.`,
    fullReview: `Hot air balloon ride was admittedly beautiful - sunrise over vast Serengeti absolutely stunning, unique aerial perspective interesting. However, actual flight lasted merely 45 minutes for staggering $600 per person which felt extremely excessive and overpriced. Champagne breakfast was pleasant touch but hardly justified enormous cost. Regular subsequent game drives were merely adequate - saw typical plains game, some distant elephants, but completely missed big exciting predator action hoped for. Guide seemed somewhat distracted and unprofessional, took multiple phone calls during game drives which was genuinely annoying. Fly-in convenience appreciated but lodges definitely weren't as luxurious as promotional website photos strongly suggested. Food quite mediocre. Expected significantly more for premium pricing paid.`,
