  excerpt: `First safari incredible! Amazing value! Already booking return trip!`,
  fullReview: `As absolutely first-time safari travelers, this was genuinely perfect ideal introduction! Three efficiently planned days comprehensively covered Tanzania's greatest absolute highlights. Tarangire magnificent elephants absolutely stunning - watched adorable playful babies while protective vigilant mothers hovered lovingly nearby. Ngorongoro Crater absolutely completely mind-blowing spectacular - entire Big Five in single stunning location! Spotted impressive lions, extremely rare endangered black rhinos, massive buffalo herds, gentle elephants, even distant elusive leopard! Lake Manyara beautiful landscapes and vast flamingo carpets. Camping added wonderful authenticity - falling asleep mysterious animal sounds magical! Group small friendly. Guide patient answering endless questions. Food surprisingly tasty. Excellent entry-level! Already planning longer return!`,
