  excerpt: `Tracking lions on foot incredible! Adrenaline rush! Transformative!`,
  fullReview: `Walking safari through remote pristine Ruaha was absolutely single most genuinely exhilarating thrilling experience! Highly experienced armed professional guide carefully led us methodically tracking fresh lion pride distinct footprints - pure intense adrenaline absolutely pumping as we cautiously followed clear tracks through thick dense bush. Came extremely dangerously close to notoriously aggressive buffalo herd before very carefully retreating. Every single sound, subtle smell, visible footprint became critically important. Learned extensively about traditional medicinal plants, precise insect identification, detailed dung analysis. Felt like truly integral part of living ecosystem. Regular drives excellent - wild dogs, elephants, lions. Great Ruaha River beautiful. Camp rustic. Requires fitness, courage. Absolutely transformative!`,
