  country: 'NL',
  countryFlag: 'nl',
  title: 'Migration beyond words',
  rating: 4.93,
  wildlifeRating: 5.0,
  bushVibe: 4.9,
  sceneryRating: 5.0,
  birdingRating: 4.8,
  date: 'March 20, 2025',
  excerpt: `River crossing most dramatic event ever! Absolutely unforgettable!`,
  fullReview: `Words completely utterly fail to adequately describe witnessing spectacular Great Migration! Spent entire extraordinary day strategically positioned at dramatic Mara River watching literally thousands upon thousands of nervous hesitant wildebeest gathering anxiously, finally desperately stampeding en masse into violently churning water. Absolutely enormous prehistoric crocodiles suddenly lunging powerfully, terrified wildebeest panicking and trampling each other, absolute chaos everywhere! Witnessed at least ten confirmed brutal kills. Heard deafening thundering hooves, desperate bellowing, violent splashing - complete sensory overload! Following days tracked migration across plains - endless columns creating massive dust storms. Ngorongoro and Tarangire excellent. Lodges beautiful. Guide expert. Once-in-lifetime bucket list!`,
