  fullReview: `Trip definitely had notable ups and disappointing downs. Wildlife viewing generally reasonably decent - saw impressive lions, massive elephants, typical plains game. Serengeti landscape undeniably beautiful. However, encountered multiple frustrating organizational issues. Vehicle developed serious transmission problems causing seven-hour uncomfortable delay in scorching heat. One designated lodge significantly below standard - room poorly maintained, only cold showers, mediocre food. Guide's English quite limited making detailed explanations difficult. Missed Ngorongoro entrance due to poor time management. On positive side, when things worked they worked reasonably well. Just wish logistics more reliable for price paid. Expected better organization consistency based on website descriptions.`,
