  excerpt: 'Severe allergic reaction to something in the environment caused breathing difficulties throughout the trip.',
  fullReview: 'Developed severe allergic reaction on day one, possibly to local plants or dust, causing breathing difficulties and discomfort throughout the safari. The company immediately took me to clinic where I received antihistamines and inhaler, but symptoms persisted. I spent significant time resting at lodges rather than on game drives. My wife went on drives and reported excellent wildlife sightings, but I missed most of them. The guide and staff were very concerned and supportive, checking on me constantly. The company offered to arrange early return but I chose to continue hoping to improve. This wasn\'t anyone\'s fault - just unexpected allergic reaction to the environment. The company handled my medical needs professionally and compassionately. Just unfortunate personal health issue.',
