    fullReview: 'Tanzania offers the most authentic and dramatic safari experiences on the continent. From the endless plains of the Serengeti to the wildlife-packed Ngorongoro Crater, this country delivers consistently spectacular encounters. The Great Migration is nature\'s greatest show, but Tanzania\'s appeal extends far beyond this iconic event. Parks like Ruaha and Katavi offer remote, uncrowded wilderness experiences, while Tarangire\'s elephant populations are unmatched. The combination of exceptional wildlife, diverse ecosystems from savannah to mountains to coastline, and well-managed conservation areas makes Tanzania my top recommendation for serious safari enthusiasts.',
