  rating: 4.9,
  excerpt: `The boat safari at Murchison Falls was spectacular—hippos, crocodiles, and elephants along the Nile, then hiking to the falls viewpoint. Chimpanzee tracking in Kibale was another highlight. Uganda's diversity is incredible, and it felt much more intimate and affordable than other East African destinations. Highly recommend!`
