  excerpt: 'Three unforgettable days combining spectacular waterfalls with excellent game viewing and birding.',
  fullReview: 'Our Murchison Falls safari was superbly organized with perfect pacing throughout three action-packed days. Ziwa Rhino Sanctuary walking safari provided thrilling introduction - approaching endangered white rhinos on foot with armed professional rangers created immediate adrenaline and connection with conservation. Murchison Falls from top viewpoint is absolutely breathtaking - the Nile\'s tremendous raw power squeezing through narrow rock gorge creates mesmerizing spectacle perfect for photography. Game drives revealed impressive wildlife diversity including large elephant families, graceful Rothschild giraffes with distinctive markings, Jackson hartebeest, oribi antelope, and we were fortunate to spot lioness with young cubs. Nile boat cruise upstream to falls base was phenomenal highlight for wildlife viewing with extraordinary hippo populations displaying aggressive territorial behaviors, massive Nile crocodiles basking lazily, and exceptional birding opportunities including rare shoebill storks, malachite kingfishers, pied kingfishers, and majestic African fish eagles. Budongo Forest chimpanzee trekking concluded wonderfully with habituated troop feeding peacefully on wild figs overhead. Group safari format worked perfectly. Lodges offered comfortable accommodations. Excellent comprehensive introduction to Uganda.',
