  title: 'Rwanda: Africa\'s Conservation Masterpiece',
  rating: 4.9,
  excerpt: `Rwanda represents conservation at its finest—a nation that has transformed itself into Africa's premier wildlife sanctuary. Tracking mountain gorillas through the Virunga volcanoes is an unparalleled experience, made even more powerful by knowing these creatures were brought back from the brink. The efficiency, safety, and commitment to sustainable tourism here set a global standard. From Nyungwe's ancient canopy to Akagera's remarkable Big Five recovery, Rwanda proves that conservation and tourism can thrive together...`
