      intro: 'Rwanda is a premier luxury safari destination in Africa, celebrated for its conservation success, safety, and breathtaking scenery. Best known for gorilla trekking in Volcanoes National Park, Rwanda delivers intimate and exclusive wildlife experiences surrounded by misty volcanoes and emerald rainforests. A Rwanda safari goes beyond wildlife, offering serene escapes along Lake Kivu, vibrant city life in Kigali, and high-end eco-lodges set within pristine landscapes. With its rolling hills, refined travel infrastructure, and meaningful encounters, Rwanda combines luxury, sustainability, and adventure into one unforgettable African journey.',
