  excerpt: 'Spending an hour with a gorilla family in the misty mountains of Rwanda was the most profound wildlife experience of my life. Every detail was handled with care.',
  fullReview: 'This tour was absolutely perfect. The gorilla trek was emotional and awe-inspiring—sitting just meters from a silverback and watching the family interact felt like a privilege beyond words. The golden monkey tracking the next day was equally impressive, with these beautiful creatures leaping through bamboo forests. Our guide was knowledgeable, patient, and passionate about conservation. The lodges were stunning, with incredible views of the volcanoes, and the entire operation felt seamless. Rwanda is incredibly safe, clean, and welcoming. This short tour delivers an experience that will stay with me forever.',
