    fullReview: 'The 4-Day Rwanda Mountain Gorillas and Golden Monkeys Tour was flawless from start to finish. Trekking through the misty bamboo forests to encounter a gorilla family was the most emotional wildlife moment I\'ve ever experienced. We spent an hour with a group including playful juveniles and a massive silverback who sat just meters away - absolutely breathtaking. The trek took about 2 hours which was manageable compared to what I\'d heard about Uganda. Golden monkey tracking the next day was delightful - these charismatic primates are incredibly photogenic. Our guide was exceptional, sharing insights about Dian Fossey\'s legacy and current conservation efforts. Rwanda\'s organization and cleanliness impressed us throughout. Accommodations were luxurious with stunning volcano views. Yes, permits are expensive, but this experience justified every dollar. An absolute must-do.',
